WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.888
Today my family is going to Chinatown.

2
00:00:03.889 --> 00:00:06.808
It's the Chinese New Year.

3
00:00:06.809 --> 00:00:12.010
So we will see a parade!

4
00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:16.064
First my brother and I spot some sweets.

5
00:00:16.065 --> 00:00:20.367
Mom buys a few for us.

6
00:00:20.368 --> 00:00:26.473
"Mmm!" I say. "Delicious!"

7
00:00:26.474 --> 00:00:30.981
Next we hear some drummers. We

8
00:00:30.982 --> 00:00:38.023
clap when the drummers play Chinese music. Whoa!

9
00:00:38.024 --> 00:00:43.548
Here comes a dancing dragon! Dad

10
00:00:43.549 --> 00:00:46.903
says dragons are special in China. They

11
00:00:46.904 --> 00:00:50.829
bring good luck in the new year. Then

12
00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:54.853
acrobats spin plates round and round. I

13
00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:57.663
worry that one will fall! But

14
00:00:57.664 --> 00:01:01.123
the acrobats are amazing. They

15
00:01:01.124 --> 00:01:04.338
don't drop any plates at all! Later

16
00:01:04.339 --> 00:01:08.104
Chinese lanterns glow in the night. Mom

17
00:01:08.105 --> 00:01:11.052
says they are beautiful. They're

18
00:01:11.053 --> 00:01:15.121
my favorite thing until I see something else. Fireworks! Boom

19
00:01:15.122 --> 00:01:19.436
! Boom !

20
00:01:19.437 --> 00:01:22.758
Bright colors sparkle in the sky.

21
00:01:22.759 --> 00:01:26.420
When it's time to go, I feel sad.

22
00:01:26.421 --> 00:01:29.979
But dad says we can come back next year.

23
00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:33.250
"Hooray!" I cheer.

24
00:01:33.251 --> 00:01:36.392
"Happy New Year!"

